        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 25 at 2:21AM AKDT until September 25 at 6:00PM AKDT by NWS Juneau AK</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Southeast winds 20 to 25 kt and seas 6 to 9 ft expected.

* WHERE...Icy Cape to Cape Suckling from 15 to 80 NM.

* WHEN...From 7 AM to 6 PM AKDT Friday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
